product-launch-motion
---------------------
The motion technique in this repository (closed-form spring step responses, the Track pattern of
summing one spring per target change, blur content swaps, edge-split stretch, per-digit odometer,
Playwright subframes + ffmpeg tmix motion blur, music-first cue placement) is adapted from
https://github.com/AbubakrChan/product-launch-motion. Only that repository's MIT-licensed skill and
reference text was used; none of its sample films, music, footage or brand assets are included.
The skill text itself (SKILL.md and references/) is vendored under director/skill/ with its LICENSE.

