Runtime dependencies (installed, not bundled)
---------------------------------------------
- Playwright (Apache 2.0) and Chromium.
- Inter font via @fontsource-variable/inter (SIL Open Font License 1.1).
- FFmpeg (LGPL/GPL depending on the build) and NumPy (BSD).

All music and sound effects are synthesized from scratch by src/audio/synth.py.

Story type (types/story)
------------------------
- Remotion (remotion.dev) renders the story type. Remotion is free for individuals and companies of up
  to three people; larger companies need a company license (https://www.remotion.dev/license).
- Baloo 2 font (SIL Open Font License 1.1) is bundled in types/story/public/fonts via @fontsource/baloo-2.
- Narration is generated per story with Microsoft Edge read-aloud voices (msedge-tts) or ElevenLabs,
  under the respective provider's terms.
